    <h3>Obtain a Kerboeros ticket</h3>

    Now that you are logged in to your shell, you are ready to
    <a href="https://web.mit.edu/Kerberos/krb5-latest/doc/user/tkt_mgmt.html#obtaining-tickets-with-kinit">obtain your Kerberos credentials</a>.
    This will help you navigate around the network without having to type your password over and over. A Kerberos ticket is also useful
    when you need to elevate your priviliges on a host.

